OL,3,GNEWSAPeople queue for water as
OL,4,Athousands without supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix thousand properties across parts of
OL,7,Fthe West Midlands have been without
OL,8,Fwater following a burst pipe, with free
OL,9,Fbottled water being handed out to
OL,10,Faffected residents.
OL,12,FRidgewood High School and Ashwood Park
OL,13,FPrimary school are closed on Wednesday,
OL,14,Fwith homes and businesses also
OL,15,Faffected.
OL,17,FTwo bottled water stations have been
OL,18,Fset up at Sainsbury's car park on
OL,19,FSandringham Way in Amblecote and at
OL,20,FKing George V Park on Lawnswood Road in
OL,21,FWordsley.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
