OL,3,GNEWSAPeople queue for water as
OL,4,Athousands without supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FHoward Perry, Severn Trent Water's head
OL,7,Fof water quality, said while progress
OL,8,Fwas being made, there were still many
OL,9,Fhomes without water.
